OL,3,GNEWSAFoo Fighters confirm date for
OL,4,ADarlington debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FFoo Fighters have confirmed they will
OL,7,Fperform in Darlington for the first
OL,8,Ftime ever when they stop off in the
OL,9,Ftown in 2027.
OL,11,FSpeculation about dates and locations
OL,12,Fhad grown after the American rock
OL,13,Fband's logo was projected on to
OL,14,FDarlington's clock tower and the pitch
OL,15,Fat Mowden Park on Thursday night.
