OL,3,GNEWSAFoo Fighters confirm date for
OL,4,ADarlington debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FDarlington Arena staff had kept the
OL,7,Fannouncement secret for eight months
OL,8,Fand, despite the stadium being more
OL,9,Fassociated with rugby nowadays,
OL,10,Fguitarist Chris Shiflett said the group
OL,11,Fwas looking forward to fans bringing
OL,12,Fsome "football culture" to the show.
OL,14,FThe band, supported by St Vincent and
OL,15,FYard Act, will finally get to sample a
OL,16,FDarlington crowd on 14 September next
OL,17,Fyear.
